  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gautam Kumar @ Gautam Kumar Sinha vs The State Of Bihar on 15 November, 2021 Author: Birendra Kumar Bench: Birendra Kumar In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Criminal Miscellaneous No.2602 of 2021 Arising Out of Ps. Case No.-427 Year-2020 Thana- Barachatti Distri ====================================================== Gautam Kumar @ Gautam Kumar Sinha, Son Of Mannu Prasad Sinha, Resident Of Village - Dobhi, P.S. - Dobhi, District - Gaya ... ... Petitioner/s Versus The State of Bihar ... ... Opposite Party/s ====================================================== Appearance : For the Petitioner/s : Mr. Md. Javed Jafar Khan, Advocate For the Opposite Party/s : Mr. A.P.P. ====================================================== Coram: Honourable Mr. Justice Birendra Kumar Oral Order 2 15-11-2021",
    "facts": "The petitioner is apprehending his arrest in a case registered for the offences punishable under Sections 272, 273, 379, 413, 411 and 406/34 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 59(ii) of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006. The police got information that from a milk carrying van, milk was to be stolen away near the line hotel of the petitioner. The milk van was found parked near the line hotel of the petitioner. Submission is that there is no direct allegation against the petitioner and the place is accessible by anyone. Any vehicle can be parked at the line hotel. Petitioner has got no criminal Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.2602 of 2021(2) dt.15-11-2021 antecedent.",
